. \`[[Well]]?\` [[asks|ask]] Mr Ba. \`[[I]] [[had|have]] [[another]] [[interview]] [[today]],\` [[says|say]] Minh. \`[[Their]] [[salary]] [[is|be]] [[better]]. [[But]] [[I]] [[like]] [[working]] [[with]] [[my]] [[hands|hand]].\` \`[[This]] [[morning]] [[you]] [[said|say]] '[[I]] don't [[know]],'\` [[says|say]] Mr Ba. \`[[A]] [[good]] [[worker]] [[can]] [[say]] [[that]]. [[You]] [[are|be]] [[my]] [[new]] [[assistant]]. [[I]] [[am|be]] [[your]] [[boss]]. [[And]] [[this]] [[is|be]] [[your]] [[colleague]].\` [[He]] [[points|point]] [[at]] an [[old]] [[grey]] [[cat]], [[asleep]] [[on]] [[a]] [[motorcycle]].`,`vn`:`N\u0103m gi\u1edd, Minh quay l\u1ea1i. \`Th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?\` ch\u00fa Ba h\u1ecfi. \`H\u00f4m nay ch\u00e1u \u0111i ph\u1ecfng v\u1ea5n \u1edf ch\u1ed7 kh\u00e1c n\u1eefa \u1ea1,\` Minh n\u00f3i. \`L\u01b0\u01a1ng b\u00ean \u0111\u00f3 cao h\u01a1n. Nh\u01b0ng ch\u00e1u th\u00edch l\u00e0m b\u1eb1ng \u0111\u00f4i tay.\` \`S\u00e1ng nay c\u1eadu \u0111\u00e3 n\u00f3i 'ch\u00e1u kh\u00f4ng bi\u1ebft',\` ch\u00fa Ba b\u1ea3o. \`Th\u1ee3 gi\u1ecfi m\u1edbi d\u00e1m n\u00f3i th\u1ebf. C\u1eadu l\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 vi\u1ec7c m\u1edbi c\u1ee7a t\u00f4i. T\u00f4i l\u00e0 s\u1ebfp c\u1ee7a c\u1eadu. C\u00f2n \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed3ng nghi\u1ec7p c\u1ee7a c\u1eadu.\` Ch\u00fa ch\u1ec9 v\u00e0o m\u1ed9t con m\u00e8o x\u00e1m gi\u00e0 \u0111ang ng\u1ee7 kh\u00ec tr\u00ean y\u00ean xe m\u00e1y.`},{`en`:`[[At]] [[midnight]], Minh [[hears|hear]] [[soft]] [[piano]] [[music]] [[from]] [[the]] [[house]] [[with]] [[the]] [[blue]] [[door]]. [[The]] [[next]] [[morning]], [[the]] [[first]] [[customer]] [[is|be]] [[waiting|wait]]. [[It]] [[is|be]] Tom, [[the]] English [[student]], [[and]] [[his]] [[old]] [[bicycle]] [[is|be]] [[in]] [[two]] [[pieces|piece]].`,`vn`:`N\u1eeda \u0111\u00eam, Minh nghe th\u1ea5y ti\u1ebfng piano khe kh\u1ebd v\u1ecdng ra t\u1eeb ng\u00f4i nh\u00e0 c\u1eeda xanh. S\u00e1ng h\u00f4m sau, v\u1ecb kh\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean \u0111\u00e3 \u011